    <!-- https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto/Geometry -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://l-jamora.github.io/m150-onto/Geometry">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The taxonomy of geometry includes the GIS geometry data of M150-Components. These include Geometry Object and Geometry Points.

It is recommended to create individuals for geometric objects with the template:

` GeoObject[PipeSection/Node Designation] `
` GeoObject[HG001]  ` for Pipe Section: Geometry Objects;
` GeoObject[KG001] ` for Node: Geometry Objects.

It is recommended to create individuals for geometric points with the template:

` GeoPoint[Geometry Point Description] `
` GeoPoint[GP001]  `.

`GeoObject`&apos;s should be declared as the parent of &apos;GeoPoint&apos;&apos;s with the object property `isParentOf`. (Inverse: isChildOf)

`GeoObject`&apos;s should be declared as the renderer of a Component with the object property &apos;renders&apos;. (Inverse: renderedBy)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


